```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Domain adapter<br/>scenarios, test sets, gold, gates]
    B[Run Agent / Skill]
    C[Collect traces and run artifacts]
    D[Four-layer diagnosis<br/>facts, behavior, language, stability]
    E[JSON report<br/>machine reading, aggregation, regression, reproduction]
    F[Markdown report<br/>generated from JSON for human review]
    G[Human review]
    H[Select the evaluated target]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G --> H

    subgraph NORMAL[Agent / Skill evolution]
        N1[Analyze bad cases]
        N2[Generate a candidate change]
        N3[Apply the candidate in an isolated workspace]
        N4[Replay improvement / regression / holdout]
        N5{Scenario-specific gates}
        N6[Human approval]
        N7[Rollback candidate]
        N1 --> N2 --> N3 --> N4 --> N5
        N5 -->|pass| N6
        N5 -->|fail| N7 --> N1
    end

    subgraph EVAL[Evaluation Skill evolution]
        E1[Classify the evaluation report]
        E2{Is the judgment correct?}
        E3[Keep as a correct historical sample]
        E4[Keep as an incorrect or partial sample]
        E5[Modify the evaluation Skill]
        E6[Replay wrong samples<br/>while protecting correct samples]
        E7{Evaluation Skill regression gate}
        E8[Keep the evaluation Skill candidate]
        E1 --> E2
        E2 -->|correct| E3
        E2 -->|incorrect or partial| E4 --> E5 --> E6 --> E7
        E7 -->|pass| E8
        E7 -->|fail| E5
    end

    H -->|Agent / Skill| N1
    H -->|evaluation Skill| E1
    N6 --> R[Record version, commit, parameters, and evidence]
    E8 --> R
    R --> S[Start the next evaluation round]
    S --> B
```
